Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.61,0:00:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.20,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-sama.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Izayoi-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.63,0:00:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.47,0:00:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Ai-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.68,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A moment, Chika-chan... M-My back... {or legs}{you can see her rubbing her lower back in the next scene}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.12,0:01:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.53,0:01:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.87,0:01:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan is amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.11,0:02:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay guys, I hear the new resident \Nlikes cats, so let's give her a proper welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.03,0:02:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sazanami Girls' Dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.88,0:03:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{la-la-la}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.04,0:03:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.44,0:04:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm Makihara Kosuke from Sazanami Dormitory!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.53,0:04:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. Nice to meet you. \NI'm Shiina.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.58,0:04:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so everyone else has already met you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, over winter break.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.76,0:04:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, except Minami-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.78,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, when did Minami move in?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.27,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Minami-chan arrive in April?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.05,0:04:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Um... Nice to meet you. \NI'm Okamoto Minami.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. \NI'm Shiina Yuuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let me reintroduce myself. \NI'm the dorm manager and cook...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.94,0:04:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...and our houseboy! {manservant/domestic duties}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.61,0:04:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.23,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sis...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.78,0:04:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just telling the truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.19,0:04:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty much the gist of it. \NI'm Makihara Kosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Please take care of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.02,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.86,0:05:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.57,0:05:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.37,0:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, reaching out \Nfor the best part despite being a newcomer?! {??????? shiniri no kuse ni, namaikina *** koiyumono ha ***}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.68,0:05:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san, another helping!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra large please!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me, Ai-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.69,0:05:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-san, could you pass it, please?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.74,0:05:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty unusual.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.70,0:05:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A husband calling his wife by "-san," I mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the same last name \Nbecause we're cousins.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that kind of relationship.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you two...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.85,0:06:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,really do act like a couple.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.02,0:06:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.94,0:06:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so worked up, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.82,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are always getting along so well.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.01,0:06:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... n-no...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan thought that at first too, didn't you? {??? could be any of them}{just had to hear it 3 times to figure out :sunglasses:}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.61,0:06:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Shiina-san, you're a music student, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.36,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm studying vocal music.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must be a good singer.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.33,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I'm really not that good.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... just a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.09,0:07:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{a lot of highly intellectual lyrics}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for listening.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.90,0:08:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina-san's really beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she really is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.15,0:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's tall, beautiful, and has a great figure.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty too, Chika-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And your figure's perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.11,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? No, it's not. \NMy chest is so tiny.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan, are you wearing A's? {bra cups size}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.60,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A size, 65 cm... {chest circumference}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.24,0:08:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A size, 69 cm...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bosom friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think mine just turns into muscle instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.25,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? It looks soft to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Can I touch?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.38,0:09:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.96,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It really does feel... comforting.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I touch too?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.90,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... excuse me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.05,0:09:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.87,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.58,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the kitty's taking a bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tora-chan loves baths. {shortening of kotora (means baby tiger)}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.86,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? So that's Kotora?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So tiny and adorable.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.97,0:10:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina-san, how do you like living here?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.18,0:10:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love it. It feels so homey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.47,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the manager's cooking is delicious too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.41,0:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Kaoru-chan, was it? \NThe girl with the braids.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.79,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.73,0:10:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems kind of lonely... \Nlike she hardly ever smiles.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.83,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.65,0:10:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to her?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.07,0:10:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru's always been like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.78,0:10:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a very stoic person. {kanzaki = kaoru}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just plain unfriendly!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.69,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Kaoru-san is nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.46,0:10:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think I've ever seen her smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.33,0:11:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.19,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.15,0:11:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, it's time for the cats' dinner meeting! {referring to the street cats she's feeding}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I've got it all ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.68,0:11:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.28,0:11:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{?? uki? ookini?}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.35,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A meeting?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.00,0:11:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! More importantly, Minami-chan, \Nthey're showing an NBA match on satellite TV. {an NBA game}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! I've gotta record it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.17,0:11:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you two just looked so close together.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, no, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.86,0:11:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you're a great cook \Nand a really nice guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been living here long?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even six months yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I moved in over spring break.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.11,0:12:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.08,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.53,0:12:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Kaoru-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.89,0:12:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to have some tea together?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.92,0:12:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I have practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.86,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki, 5th-dan in the Ittou-Ryu school. \NVice captain of Kazegaoka Academy's kendo club. { Ittō-ryū; school of swordsmanship founded during the early Edo period, from which many later schools branched - usually I translate it as "two-handed fencing" because it's just one big-ass sword that you can only wield with both your hooves but muzu changed it back }
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.19,0:12:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a kendo practitioner.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.64,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... is that why she seems so serious? {"stoic" before}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.04,0:12:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.09,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.17,0:12:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.57,0:13:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina-san, are you done with school already?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.03,0:13:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I only had two classes this morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So then...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was just...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.01,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, going to some kind of get-together? {konpa =  party; social event; get-together; mixer​}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, only to the one at Sazanami Dorm. {meaning it won't be with some outsiders but right here in the dorm}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.79,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone there is so cheerful.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.83,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Except Kaoru-chan hardly ever smiles.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.86,0:13:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.87,0:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's the plan... \NI'm gonna make her laugh her head off!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.29,0:13:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... So you're that kind of person?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.49,0:13:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly that kind! {That's exactly what it is!}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.94,0:13:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,since you've discovered my secret plan...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.14,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.20,0:14:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have some water.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Manager-san! {imma assume she talks kansai ben or something}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.78,0:14:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaoru-chan asks, \N"What are you doing?", you should...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.66,0:14:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.44,0:14:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san, what's for dinner today?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.67,0:15:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.80,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying a new look?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.85,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You were saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See? That would've been perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.32,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, why didn't it work on Kaoru-chan earlier? Darn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.72,0:15:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.55,0:15:30.71,Thought,,0,0,0,,Looks like Shiina-san and Kosuke \Nare trying to make Kaoru-san smile.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.71,0:15:31.74,Thought,,0,0,0,,And later...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.87,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm, delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... my phone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.65,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.07,0:16:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yuuhi!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.62,0:16:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.84,0:16:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So is it true that every time you sleep{sleep}, you lose brain cells?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely true!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.17,0:16:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to sleep less often!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.62,0:16:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? How often?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.89,0:17:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a week!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.07,0:17:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you do that, your body won't hold up!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.20,0:17:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the strange part: it does!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? How'd you manage that?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.16,0:17:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I sleep once a week, \Nfrom Monday through Friday!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's way too much sleeping!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your attention!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.85,0:17:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's time for my practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.02,0:17:31.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,They tried all sorts of things, \Nbut they didn't seem to have much effect.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.81,0:17:35.32,Thought,,0,0,0,,Before we knew it, even the way \Nthey addressed each other had changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.32,0:17:39.58,Thought,,0,0,0,,Lately, the two of them have seemed \Nlike lifelong best friends. {muzu and perevo}{Ralem and Animo}{Blasphemboys and mid-anime}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.27,0:17:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one week until Kaoru-chan's birthday. \NThis is where we comedians earn our keep!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.65,0:17:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... why are you calling yourself a comedian?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. \NJust leave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.98,0:18:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Around eight o'clock?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, about then.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I understand. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.07,0:18:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... they told me to be home by exactly eight.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.79,0:18:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, today's your birthday. \NThey're probably getting something ready for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.15,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of attention is a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.34,0:18:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. \NEveryone's just being nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.43,0:18:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... and I'm always grateful for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.86,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, preparations are just about good to go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.95,0:18:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mio-chan. \NThat's our fearless leader.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! \NYou can pat me on the head if you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.17,0:18:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. \NAs a special reward...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.42,0:19:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{purr purr}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.88,0:19:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Yuuhi-chan doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.62,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Apparently it's just her own little ritual.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.05,0:19:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Just leave her be.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.81,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.12,0:19:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.57,0:19:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.56,0:19:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy, happy, happy, Kaoru-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.06,0:19:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy, happy, happy, Kaoru-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.44,0:19:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy, happy, happy birthday! \NCongratulations!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.73,0:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.57,0:20:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.74,0:20:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.88,0:20:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.68,0:20:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But man... you made festival coats \Nfor all these kitties... impressive! {happi}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.43,0:20:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-kun worked really hard on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.51,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Honestly, I almost gave up at one point.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.23,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, this has a nice old-fashioned charm to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, why don't you put on a yukata?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.84,0:20:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everyone should. \NKaoru-san too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.75,0:21:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a yukata with me...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.28,0:21:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. \NYou can borrow one of mine if you'd like.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.80,0:21:20.38,Thought,,0,0,0,,After that, everyone changed \Ninto yukatas and we set off fireworks.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.38,0:21:25.35,Thought,,0,0,0,,It was the first time I {chika}\Nhad ever seen Kaoru-san laugh that hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.10,0:21:32.49,Thought,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help thinking Kosuke and Yuuhi-chan \Nwere really something special. {amazing}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.03,0:21:41.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,The end.{maru = circle - I assume she means period = the end [of a letter]}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.30,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But why were you so determined \Nto make Kanzaki-san laugh, Yuuhi?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.34,0:22:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a comedian at heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:21.32,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls deserve to laugh with all they've got.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.62,0:22:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has worries and painful things in life...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.84,0:22:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they stop being able to laugh because of them, \Nlife just isn't much fun for a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.44,0:22:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.76,0:22:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, partway through, \Nit also became a matter of pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.98,0:22:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also had my fun \Nacting like an idiot together with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.40,0:22:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, a girl laughing her heart out \Nis the best thing there is.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.73,0:22:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:59.24,0:23:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always smiling, Yuuhi.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.71,0:23:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.22,0:23:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Always smiling?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.56,0:23:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuuhi... I...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.73,0:23:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.33,0:24:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.50,0:24:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me... {??????? uchi? inside?}{me too}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.86,0:25:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:26.34,0:25:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kosuke-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.30,0:26:47.09,Thought,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:54.97,0:26:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up or you'll be late.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.10,0:26:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:58.42,0:27:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Chika-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:00.22,0:27:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:02.19,0:27:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:04.15,0:27:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:18.00,0:27:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:20.04,0:27:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:24.41,0:27:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.88,0:27:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:57.51,0:28:09.89,Song,,0,0,0,,{same song as ep 1 but different part of it: https://utaten.com/lyric/to16064644/ }Let's walk on without looking back through the crowd\NA brand-new story is just beginning
Dialogue: 10,0:28:09.89,0:28:21.63,Song,,0,0,0,,I spent those lonely nights with you\NHolding feelings my lips could never say
Dialogue: 10,0:28:21.63,0:28:27.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart\NYour eyes that day
Dialogue: 10,0:28:29.34,0:28:33.91,Song,,0,0,0,,Reflected the color of the sky
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.91,0:28:35.72,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.72,0:28:47.69,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if the promise we made hand in hand\Nseems ready to disappear into the headwind...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:48.66,0:28:54.97,Song,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are always wide open and unbeatable
Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.97,0:29:01.27,Song,,0,0,0,,No matter how long the stormy night lasts,\Nit'll soon give way to blue skies
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.27,0:29:15.92,Song,,0,0,0,,See? Our hearts are ultimately unbeatable! \NLet's face the wind with our heads held high
Comment: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:18.92,Song,,0,0,0,,
